<section class="z-signs" id="znamenja" aria-labelledby="z-signs-title">
  <div class="z-section-heading"><div><span class="z-kicker">DVANAJST POGLEDOV NA VAŠ DAN</span><h2 id="z-signs-title">Poiščite svoje <em>znamenje.</em></h2></div><span class="z-small-note">Tropski zodiak · običajni datumski razponi</span></div>
  <div class="z-filters" role="group" aria-label="Filtriraj znamenja po elementu"><% ['Vsa znamenja','Ogenj','Zemlja','Zrak','Voda'].each_with_index do |element,index| %><button type="button" data-sign-filter="<%= index.zero? ? 'all' : element %>" aria-pressed="<%= index.zero? %>"><%= element %><% if index.zero? %><span>12</span><% end %></button><% end %></div>
  <div class="z-card-grid" role="list"><% @horoscope_guide.profiles.each_with_index do |sign,index| %><div class="z-card" role="listitem" data-sign-card="<%= sign['slug'] %>" data-element="<%= sign['element'] %>"><a href="/horoskop/<%= sign['slug'] %>/"><div class="z-card-art"><span class="z-card-number" aria-hidden="true"><%= '%02d' % (index+1) %></span><img src="/horoscope/art/<%= sign['slug'] %>-v1.svg" width="320" height="310" loading="lazy" decoding="async" alt="<%= sign['art_alt'] %>"><span class="z-element"><%= sign['element'] %></span></div><div class="z-card-copy"><div><h3><%= sign['name'] %></h3><span class="z-card-arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span></div><p class="z-card-date"><%= sign['dates'] %></p><p class="z-card-excerpt" data-card-copy><%= @horoscope_guide.reading(sign['slug'])['title'] || sign['intro'] %></p><span class="z-card-link">Preberite dnevni horoskop <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></span></div></a></div><% end %></div>
  <p class="z-small-note">Na mejnih dnevih se znamenje lahko razlikuje glede na leto in uro rojstva. <a href="#ascendent">Izračunajte sončno in vzhajajoče znamenje.</a></p>
</section>
